Error [E0926]: this duration's unit isn't a recognized schedule cadence
  --> tests/ui/schedule_bad_duration_unit.jet:4:9
    |
  4 | @Every(5px)
    |         ^^
 Why: a schedule's repeat interval is one of a closed set of time units — `ns`/`us`/`ms`/`s`/`min` — not an arbitrary `@UnitFamily` member.
 Fix: use `ns`, `us`, `ms`, `s`, or `min` (e.g. `@Every(5min)`).
